# Private keys. The trust anchor key in particular is the root of the entire
# mesh's identity -- it must never be committed, even for a throwaway demo.
certs/*.key
certs/*.crt

# Generated k3d cluster configs (source of truth is clusters/lib.sh)
clusters/.generated/

# Experiment output: captured metrics, baselines, charts.
# FINDINGS.md is the write-up, not output -- keep it.
#
# Note `results/*` rather than `results/`: git does not descend into an excluded
# directory, so a negation inside one can never match. Excluding the contents
# instead leaves the directory walkable.
results/*
!results/FINDINGS.md
!results/SHORTCOMINGS.md

# Per-run write-ups are write-ups too, and the same reasoning that keeps
# FINDINGS.md applies to them: they are prose about a run, not the run's output.
# FINDINGS.md already cross-references `results/run-2026-08-17/SUMMARY.md`, and
# under the rule above that file was never tracked -- a published document
# pointing at something no clone contains.
#
# Three lines rather than one, for the reason the note above gives: git does not
# descend into an excluded directory, so `!results/run-*/SUMMARY.md` alone can
# never match. Re-admit the run directories, exclude their contents, then
# re-admit the write-up.
!results/run-*/
results/run-*/*
!results/run-*/SUMMARY.md

# Sampler output. The page and the exporter are source; feeds are run artifacts,
# same as results/ -- and live.ndjson grows for as long as a game day lasts.
viz/data/

# Archived Prometheus TSDBs. Hundreds of MB per run, and reconstructable from a
# live rig -- see `task archive:save`. The numbers the write-up depends on live
# in results/ as metric snapshots; this is only what makes the Grafana panels
# replayable after the clusters are gone.
prometheus-archive/

# Local overrides (licenses, Buoyant Cloud credentials).
# The glob matters: a bare `settings.local.sh` does not match editor backups or
# copies like settings.local.sh.bak, which contain exactly the same secret.
settings.local.sh*
.env
*.bak

# macOS Finder metadata.
.DS_Store
